# Local-first Omni policy

1. Do **not** configure or rely on Context7 / Upstash paid doc APIs — use `./external-docs` mirrors backed by citations.
2. PostHog must target **self-hosted** URLs from `.env`, never Cloud defaults silently.
3. Prefer GitNexus + dependency graphs for structural questions before guessing imports.
4. BookStack/FumaDocs/Post hobby stacks run on localhost or infra you control — document ports in README when changing.

If a third-party SaaS appears necessary: stop and add an ADR proposal first.
